  "task_scope": "正式语料连续窗口盲抽取；事件数量和边界未知。",
  "source_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0020",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 20,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0020",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：08：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0021",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 21,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0021",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：（说）好厉害啊，这个炮、飞机呀。问他厉害到什么程度啊，你们伤了多少人？不知道。所以这样的时候，就更使得我们这个部队（士气高涨），你没有打你就往后跑，还说厉害，我们这个部队士气就更……就是非打个好仗不行啊。那天晚上唐亮主任是分配组织股、宣传股跟着营里面参加战斗政治鼓励工作，民运股，曾思玉（音）的股长，留在后边，准备接收俘虏，准备动员担架。把我呢，说你协助民运股工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0022",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 22,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0022",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：09：06"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0023",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 23,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0023",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：那天晚上12点我们部队就出发了，部队出发以后就下雨，到山上，在那里等着进攻开始。部队也淋湿了，也比较冷，但是大家都不会因为这个冷情绪不高，就是第一仗一定要打好。在天亮以后啊，敌人他很警觉，也好像发现了情况，我们看着他好像也发现我们了，我们就发起进攻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0024",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 24,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0024",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：杨老这个时候我问一下，咱们进攻的时候啊，是发的信号弹还是吹的冲锋号？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0025",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 25,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0025",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：10：10"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0026",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 26,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0026",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：两样都有，信号弹是师部、旅部发出信号，团以下啊就吹冲锋号了。我不在现场，但是我听到一些回来的人讲。我讲这些东西我不参加。当时两个团，685团在左翼，686团在右翼，这个部队冲下去，敌人呢，能跑的他就往那个雨裂沟里跑，他不是可以躲起来吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0027",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 27,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0027",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：11：13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0028",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 28,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0028",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：没有跑掉的，后面的没有进去的，我们的手榴弹和机枪、步枪不就打他嘛！把敌人赶到那个雨裂沟里面去以后啊，部队又去搜索。按照我们国内战争的办法，我们下去（就可以）抓俘虏了。结果他那个非常顽强，枪也打得很准，你要一露头，他一枪就把你这个头上打个洞，就牺牲了。这一个雨裂沟里呀，人多人少也没准，一个的有，两个的有，上十个人的也有，他都挤到雨裂沟里隐蔽，利用那个沟边上可以打我们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0029",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 29,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0029",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：12：11"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0030",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 30,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0030",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：所以这个时候伤亡一些人。马上改变方法，先弄一个两个手榴弹下去，再下去，这手榴弹爆炸里边不是伤就是亡，就缴枪了。我们685团在当场冲锋，连长、指导员就带着冲锋的时候，我记得比较清楚的，那个连长叫什么名，我现在一下想不起来了，是原来刘亚楼的警卫员，打仗很勇敢，大个子。有一个连的指导员叫郑什么友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0031",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 31,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0031",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：13：10"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0032",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 32,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0032",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：他们两个人啊，就在冲这个的时候……他们两个不在一个连，这个连长牺牲了，指导员负伤了，因为干部带头啊。这个战斗打到下午，我们685团这个方向的敌人就占据东西跑池，利用村庄顽抗，右边686团这个方向的敌人呢，爬到山上一个老爷庙，在那个地方顽抗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0033",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 33,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0033",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：14：05"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0034",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 34,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0034",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：右边686团，左边是685团。《解放军报》我看的有一个人写的通讯，他就是把这个连长、指导员的牺牲呢，他说是686团。我因为这个事我就不好写信给解放军报纸，因为现在去争这个没意思了，因为很多人都闹不清，两个团长，686团杨勇是副团长，原来是政委，686团团长是李天佑，李天佑在林彪负伤，陈光代理师长的时候啊，李天佑就代理（343旅）旅长了，以后就是杨勇，咱们恢复政委的时候，他是团长兼政委，所以两个团都是姓杨的头，他容易混了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0035",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 35,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0035",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：15：21"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0036",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 36,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0036",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：其实这个牺牲的连长和负伤的指导员应该是685团的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0037",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 37,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0037",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：欸！报纸登了我想是不是写个信给报纸，因为我也考虑现在已经过了这么久了，没多大意思了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0038",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 38,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0038",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：现在提说这个老爷庙那边打得是比较激烈的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0039",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 39,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0039",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：欸！这个东西跑池啊，是头一天晚上（还）是第二天晚上，他守在村子里边，他有隐蔽物，咱们进攻的时候呢，咱们是没有隐蔽物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0040",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 40,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0040",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：16：13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0041",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 41,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0041",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：最左边那个营啊，就是梁兴初的营长，所以685团的这三个营啊，打得伤亡都很大，686团伤亡也不小，但具体数（字）因为我们不在一起，不知道，反正伤亡都很大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0042",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 42,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0042",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：685团伤亡有多少？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0043",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 43,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0043",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：整个战役，这个战斗下来以后，有800。下来以后还剩下900人，我们上战场1000多人嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0044",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 44,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0044",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：也是将近一半了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0045",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 45,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0045",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：（总人数的）不到一半，战斗部队是一半了，因为这个团的机关里面他伤亡就小啊，他还占了一部分人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0046",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 46,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0046",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：17：10"
    }
  ]
}
